                <pb facs="0142" n="48" xml:id="pg48"/>
                <p>Losses at Ya-chou Fu not yet estimated.</p>
                <p>Made on behalf of the American Baptist Missionary Union by—</p>
                <p rendition="#right"><hi rendition="#small-caps">Geo. Warner</hi>,<lb/><hi
